sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Receptionist
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API
    participant S as PatientImportService
    participant P as PatientsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    R->>W: Choose .xlsx or .csv file
    W->>A: POST /patients/import/parse with the file
    A-->>W: headers, rows, suggested column mapping
    R->>W: Confirm or change the column mapping
    W->>A: POST /patients/import with dryRun true, all rows
    A->>S: validate every row, find duplicates
    S->>DB: read phone and CNIC of existing patients
    S-->>W: per row would_create, duplicate or error
    R->>W: Pick duplicate rule and press Import
    loop each batch of 500 rows
        W->>A: POST /patients/import with dryRun false
        A->>S: lock the organization for this process
        loop each valid row
            S->>P: create the patient
            P->>DB: insert patient and audit row in one transaction
        end
        S-->>W: per row created, duplicate or error
    end
    W-->>R: Summary and optional error report CSV
